  "prefLabel": "Rev 2001.20 Village district",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2001.20 \"Village district\" means any local governmental unit which has adopted the provisions of RSA 52 or chapter law creating a specific district or precinct.\n\nSource. #10675, eff 9-24-14 (from Rev 2001.15); ss by #14072, eff 9-10-24 (formerly Rev 2001.18)",
